                "text": "This week, I visited Starfish Family Services along with @SenPolehanki. Their team is doing incredible work, serving nearly a thousand little ones across 14 early-childhood centers and running mental health clinics that support families from birth to adulthood.  We talked honestly about what families are facing: long waitlists for Medicaid mental health, the need for more behavioral health services, and how hard it is to get the care when you need it most.",
